changelog: v1 four-bar Carlton Barrett-style one drop — kick and snare both land on beat 3, beat 1 is left empty (hence the name). Hi-hat closes on every 16th, foot pedal pulses the off-quarters. Wikipedia 'one drop sixteenth-note drum pattern'.

